  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f22d1930-ac6e-4ae7-ae1f-7cf18f3f52d3.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/smSCxUTzvp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1040918/description_e13028a0-c225-4906-873c-0fe77fa43c6b.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540iq.firewall\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1082782/description_44745406-18bd-4705-bb27-56298f9805ce.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"https://patreon.com/FIREWALLco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1040918/description_1fe6d376-3e7f-424d-9e08-253ef6ca66cb.png\"></a><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@thatdudepeter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1040918/description_c6635aca-796f-4eb9-8b64-f1a12be153fc.png\"></a><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fThatDudeAyas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1040918/description_7d77ee8e-8ae2-49b1-875e-bb02d2d25683.png\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">новое обновление добавляет:</h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">бункеробой<br>мощные версии оружия<br>блоки назначения для ракет<br>лучше взрыв ядерной бомбы<br>эмиссионный взрыв ядерной бомбы<br>больше рецептов и изменённые рецепты<br>лучшие переменные взрыва<br>исправления ошибок</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">этот мод добавляет всё, что связано с современным боем, это добавляет</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">разрывные снаряды</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">тактическое снаряжение</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">серии убийств</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">разное</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">и т.д...</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:left\">РЕЦЕПТЫ:</h1><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1082782/description_025ff60f-485b-46a5-a092-f1f53c8c8497.png\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1082782/description_5101d309-786e-4c20-a300-aedd4fa45bd8.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1082782/description_9a6ba901-4b4d-4f88-8a15-c78bdeaf2993.png\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1082782/description_9c289e84-5ff5-4a72-9204-7412f761c4dc.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1082782/description_96a32f49-0d70-4ef8-89db-32290a6b8b24.png\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1082782/description_4d7efe80-075b-4325-9de8-e6a41975e374.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1082782/description_41835fbf-a8dc-432b-be70-211e020c27ec.png\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1082782/description_a81a244a-21a1-414b-a716-99b187ba8b0c.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1082782/description_365b226f-5740-48a0-ab00-1a5af88d82c0.png\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1082782/description_331a9995-0170-4be5-9f97-53090b6e20d6.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1082782/description_b2761415-b3c5-4cfe-943c-3d5e7398388f.png\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1082782/description_3dd88ab7-d78d-